# Supabase — create a project at https://supabase.com (eCommerceCanada org)
# Run supabase/00-full-schema.sql once in SQL Editor (personal encrypted sync + company tables).
#
# Migrating from an old project? See scripts/migrate-supabase-data.mjs and .env.migration.
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values (never commit .env).
#
# Auth: Supabase → Authentication → Providers → Email → Confirm email OFF (recommended).
# Site URL: https://your-app.netlify.app (not notes://). Add redirect URLs per docs/NETLIFY.md.
# Optional only if you turn Confirm email ON: VITE_SIGNUP_EMAIL_CONFIRM=true and VITE_AUTH_REDIRECT_URL
#
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_your-key-here
# VITE_AUTH_REDIRECT_URL=https://your-app.netlify.app/auth/confirmed
#
# Netlify (dinonotes): set VITE_SUPABASE_URL, VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY, and
# VITE_AUTH_REDIRECT_URL in Site → Environment variables, then redeploy.
# See docs/NETLIFY.md for Supabase redirect URLs and SQL patches.

# Netlify sets VITE_BASE=/ automatically via netlify.toml
# Desktop/Electron builds use the default base path ./
